<title>NEW ZEALAND: RUGBY UNION-NSW BEAT OTAGO 27-16 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NSW BEAT OTAGO 27-16 IN SUPER 12 MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>DUNEDIN, New Zealand 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>New South Wales beat Otago 27-16 (halftime 17-9) in a Super 12 series rugby union match at Carisbrook on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New South Wales - Tries: Jason Madz, Alistair Murdoch, Michael Brial. Conversions: Matthew Burke 3. Penalties: Burke 2.</p>
<p>Otago - Tries: Lio Falaniko. Conversions: Simon Culhane 1. Penalties: Culhane 3.</p>
